qos: a third render thread for texture work (BOTS_GFX_WORKER=1; the launcher's "Render threads: 3").

Texture levels of 64 KB or more of guest data are copied in two halves at once: the render thread untiles,
byte-swaps and BC-decodes the first half of the level's block rows, the worker (texture_worker.h) the second half;
the render thread waits for it, then records the upload as before. Counted in the textures log line ("levels
copied with the texture worker").

